The applicant is ordered to be released on anticipatory bail in the event of arrest in connection with the aforesaid F.I.R. on executing a personal bond of Rs.10,000/- with one surety of like amount on the following conditions;
 (a) shall cooperate   investigation and make  interrogation whenever required;
